s"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TVariables"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onMutateResult"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TOnMutateResult"},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"context"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/MutationFunctionContext.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"MutationFunctionContext"}]},{"type":"text","value":") => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Called when the mutation of this call succeeds or fails, after the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSettled"},{"type":"text","value":" of the mutation options."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineHtml","value":"<a id=\"property-onsuccess\">"},{"type":"inlineHtml","value":"</a>"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSuccess?"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"data"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"variables"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TVariables"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onMutateResult"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TOnMutateResult"},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"context"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/MutationFunctionContext.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"MutationFunctionContext"}]},{"type":"text","value":") => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Called when the mutation of this call succeeds, after the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSuccess"},{"type":"text","value":" of the mutation options."}]}]]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"terror","text":"TError","level":3},{"id":"tvariables","text":"TVariables","level":3},{"id":"tonmutateresult","text":"TOnMutateResult","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/types.ts:2006](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/types.ts#L2006)\n\nThe callbacks that can be passed to `mutate` for a single call. They run after the callbacks of\nthe mutation options.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `unknown`\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](../type-aliases/DefaultError.md)\n\n### TVariables\n\n`TVariables` = `void`\n\n### TOnMutateResult\n\n`TOnMutateResult` = `unknown`\n\n## Properties\n\n| Property | Type | Description |\n| ------ | ------ | ------ |\n| <a id=\"property-onerror\"></a> `onError?` | (`error`: `TError`, `variables`: `TVariables`, `onMutateResult`: `TOnMutateResult` \\| `undefined`, `context`: [`MutationFunctionContext`](../type-aliases/MutationFunctionContext.md)) => `void` | Called when the mutation of this call fails, after the `onError` of the mutation options. |\n| <a id=\"property-onsettled\"></a> `onSettled?` | (`data`: `TData` \\| `undefined`, `error`: `TError` \\| `null`, `variables`: `TVariables`, `onMutateResult`: `TOnMutateResult` \\| `undefined`, `context`: [`MutationFunctionContext`](../type-aliases/MutationFunctionContext.md)) => `void` | Called when the mutation of this call succeeds or fails, after the `onSettled` of the mutation options. |\n| <a id=\"property-onsuccess\"></a> `onSuccess?` | (`data`: `TData`, `variables`: `TVariables`, `onMutateResult`: `TOnMutateResult` \\| `undefined`, `context`: [`MutationFunctionContext`](../type-aliases/MutationFunctionContext.md)) => `void` | Called when the mutation of this call succeeds, after the `onSuccess` of the mutation options. |\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: MutateOptions\ntitle: MutateOptions\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/types.ts:2006](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/types.ts#L2006)\n\nThe callbacks that can be passed to `mutate` for a single call. They run after the callbacks of\nthe mutation options.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `unknown`\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](../type-aliases/DefaultError.md)\n\n### TVariables\n\n`TVariables` = `void`\n\n### TOnMutateResult\n\n`TOnMutateResult` = `unknown`\n\n## Properties\n\n| Property | Type | Description |\n| ------ | ------ | ------ |\n| <a id=\"property-onerror\"></a> `onError?` | (`error`: `TError`, `variables`: `TVariables`, `onMutateResult`: `TOnMutateResult` \\| `undefined`, `context`: [`MutationFunctionContext`](../type-aliases/MutationFunctionContext.md)) => `void` | Called when the mutation of this call fails, after the `onError` of the mutation options. |\n| <a id=\"property-onsettled\"></a> `onSettled?` | (`data`: `TData` \\| `undefined`, `error`: `TError` \\| `null`, `variables`: `TVariables`, `onMutateResult`: `TOnMutateResult` \\| `undefined`, `context`: [`MutationFunctionContext`](../type-aliases/MutationFunctionContext.md)) => `void` | Called when the mutation of this call succeeds or fails, after the `onSettled` of the mutation options. |\n| <a id=\"property-onsuccess\"></a> `onSuccess?` | (`data`: `TData`, `variables`: `TVariables`, `onMutateResult`: `TOnMutateResult` \\| `undefined`, `context`: [`MutationFunctionContext`](../type-aliases/MutationFunctionContext.md)) => `void` | Called when the mutation of this call succeeds, after the `onSuccess` of the mutation options. |\n"}
